---
import "../../styles/global.css";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
import Header from "../../components/Header.astro";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />

    <title>Garel Green Marble Decorative Set | KASODI</title>

    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Discover the Garel green and ecru marble decorative set by Kave Home, selected by KASODI for its natural stone, graphic pattern and sculptural presence."
    />

    <!-- Google Consent Mode -->
    <script is:inline>
      window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
      function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}

      gtag('consent', 'default', {
        'analytics_storage': 'denied',
        'ad_storage': 'denied',
        'ad_user_data': 'denied',
        'ad_personalization': 'denied',
        'wait_for_update': 500
      });
    </script>

    <!-- CookieYes -->
    <script
      id="cookieyes"
      type="text/javascript"
      src="https://cdn-cookieyes.com/client_data/7b4b6d349a42e046975a63e4/script.js"
    ></script>

    <!-- Google Analytics -->
    <script
      async
      src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-2VBVEW2NGJ"
    ></script>

    <script is:inline>
      window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
      function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}
      gtag('js', new Date());
      gtag('config', 'G-2VBVEW2NGJ');
    </script>
  </head>

  <body>
    <Header />

    <main class="product-detail-page">

      <!-- Breadcrumbs -->
      <div class="product-breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">HOME</a>
        <span>&middot;</span>
        <a href="/interesting-finds">INTERESTING FINDS</a>
        <span>&middot;</span>
        <span>GAREL GREEN MARBLE DECORATIVE SET</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Product Hero -->
      <section class="product-detail-hero">

        <div class="product-detail-image">
          <img
            src="/images/interesting-finds/kave-home-garel-green-marble-decorative-set.png"
            alt="Garel green and ecru marble decorative set by Kave Home"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="product-detail-content">

          <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
            KASODI EDIT &middot; INTERESTING FINDS
          </p>

          <h1>Garel Green Marble Decorative Set</h1>

          <p class="product-detail-brand">Kave Home</p>

          <p class="product-detail-intro">
            A striking decorative object crafted entirely from natural marble.
            Garel combines deep green and warm ecru stone in a graphic checked
            composition, bringing sculptural character and a playful sense of
            geometry to a coffee table, console or styled shelf.
          </p>

          <div class="product-detail-divider"></div>

          <div class="product-detail-meta">

            <div>
              <span>MATERIAL</span>
              <strong>100% Marble</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>DIMENSIONS</span>
              <strong>30 &times; 30 &times; 2 cm</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>COLOUR</span>
              <strong>Green &middot; Ecru</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>FINISH</span>
              <strong>Natural &middot; Veined</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>PIECES</span>
              <strong>24</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>WEIGHT</span>
              <strong>6.13 kg</strong>
            </div>

          </div>

          <div class="affiliate-action">
            <a
              href="https://kavehome.com/es/en/p/garel-green-and-beige-marble-decorative-set-30-x-30-cm?utm_affaid=kasodi"
              target="_blank"
              rel="nofollow sponsored"
              class="product-shop-button"
            >
              Find It Here &rarr;
            </a>

            <p class="affiliate-note">
              Affiliate link &middot; KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </section>


      <!-- Why We Love It -->
      <section class="why-we-love">

        <div class="why-we-love-label">
          KASODI NOTE
        </div>

        <div class="why-we-love-content">

          <h2>Why we love it</h2>

          <p>
            Garel sits somewhere between a decorative object and a classic
            tabletop game, which is exactly what makes it such an interesting
            piece. The combination of deep green and creamy ecru marble gives
            the graphic checked pattern a sophisticated, almost architectural
            quality.
          </p>

          <p>
            Because it is made from natural marble, every set has its own
            variations in colour, veining and texture. We like it styled where
            it can remain visible rather than stored away: on a coffee table,
            library table or large console alongside books, ceramics and other
            collected objects.
          </p>

        </div>
      </section>


      <!-- Care -->
      <section class="product-care">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">CARE</p>

        <h2>Natural stone deserves a gentle touch.</h2>

        <p>
          Handle the marble pieces with care and protect the surface from hard
          knocks or abrasive materials. Natural variations in colour, veining
          and texture are part of the character of the stone and make every
          piece unique.
        </p>

      </section>


      <!-- Styling Ideas -->
      <section class="styling-ideas">

        <div class="styling-heading">
          <p>KASODI STYLING</p>
          <h2>Style it with</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="styling-grid">

          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Dark Wood</h3>
            <p>
              Place it on walnut or other deep-toned wood to bring out the
              richness of the green marble.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Warm Ceramics</h3>
            <p>
              Pair the graphic stone with softly shaped ivory or earthy
              ceramics for a more relaxed composition.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Collected Books</h3>
            <p>
              Style it beside a small stack of art and interiors books for the
              feeling of a thoughtfully collected home.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </section>


      <!-- Continue Exploring -->
      <section class="continue-exploring">

        <div class="continue-exploring-heading">
          <p>KASODI EDIT</p>
          <h2>Continue Exploring</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="continue-exploring-grid">

          <a
            href="/home-decor/lurea-sculptural-glass-centrepiece"
            class="continue-card"
          >
            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/home-decor/kave-home-lurea-sculptural-glass-centrepiece.png"
                alt="Lurea Sculptural Glass Centrepiece"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>HOME DECOR</span>
              <h3>Lurea Sculptural Glass Centrepiece</h3>
              <p>Kave Home</p>
              <strong>Discover &rarr;</strong>
            </div>
          </a>


          <a
            href="/home-decor/drava-burgundy-ceramic-table-lamp"
            class="continue-card"
          >
            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/home-decor/kave-home-drava-burgundy-ceramic-table-lamp.png"
                alt="Drava Burgundy Ceramic Table Lamp"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>LIGHTING</span>
              <h3>Drava Burgundy Ceramic Table Lamp</h3>
              <p>Kave Home</p>
              <strong>Discover &rarr;</strong>
            </div>
          </a>


          <a
            href="/tableware/talara-carved-glass-decanter"
            class="continue-card"
          >
            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/tableware/kave-home-talara-carved-glass-decanter.png"
                alt="Talara Carved Glass Decanter"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>TABLEWARE</span>
              <h3>Talara Carved Glass Decanter</h3>
              <p>Kave Home</p>
              <strong>Discover &rarr;</strong>
            </div>
          </a>

        </div>
      </section>


      <!-- Final CTA -->
      <section class="product-final-cta">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          KAVE HOME &middot; GAREL
        </p>

        <h2>A playful object, carved in natural stone.</h2>

        <a
          href="https://kavehome.com/es/en/p/garel-green-and-beige-marble-decorative-set-30-x-30-cm?utm_affaid=kasodi"
          target="_blank"
          rel="nofollow sponsored"
          class="product-shop-button"
        >
          Find It Here &rarr;
        </a>

        <p class="affiliate-note affiliate-note-light">
          Affiliate link &middot; KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
        </p>

      </section>

    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>